# Editor files
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ctxloom's private-state rules live in .ctxloom/.gitignore, which ctxloom owns
# and rewrites wholesale. Keeping them here let two retired patterns (pieces/,
# ephemeral/ — paths nothing writes) outlive the list they came from, while
# state/ and *.lock never arrived. A nested file has no user-authored lines to
# preserve, so it can be rewritten to match rather than appended to.

# ctxloom harness backups
*.ctxloom.bak
